			"notes": "Maintenance and compatibility release for the Forge 1.20.1 port.\n\nHighlights:\n- Adds optional Simple Voice Chat and Immersive Vehicles replay compatibility.\n- Fixes replay exit hanging after the replay viewer disconnects.\n- Fixes chat rendering when the replay chat option is disabled.\n- Fixes rewind lighting, stale blocks/entities/particles, and paused animation drift.\n- Improves Forge packet handling to prevent replay disconnects and network-error storms.\n- Adds deterministic Oculus/Iris shader timing during export.\n\nRequirements: Minecraft 1.20.1, Forge 47.4.10 or newer, and Java 17.\n\nSHA-256: `14ea58efb6d80ba1067bcb746e8ca94f215357e9b9ac08b098df3dcee01da87a`\n\nThis is an unofficial Forge port and is not supported by the original Flashback project."
		},
